{"v":4,"catch":"迴盪銀河的音樂益智遊戲","desc":"《Rytmos》是一款令人心曠神怡的益智遊戲，你將在其中一邊通過迷宮的考驗一邊創作音樂。 \n在星際間旅行，探索全新的樂聲。 \n解開方塊狀行星每一面上的謎題，便可完成一小段音樂，就這樣慢慢完成整首曲子。 \n超過二十種音樂玩具可供探索，還能即興來點行星音樂。\n一邊玩遊戲一邊深入瞭解音樂發展史。","publisher":"Floppy Club","release":"2023-03-02","genres":["益智","學習","音樂"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","荷蘭文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.8GB / Switch 0.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b2c3510a9b75049da6fb9fdb44a806a14b51f912bf485a06092201ec4804098d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d0b9bd36485cfe7625784a2af8633dede42dfa711c82d216d4760ca94d39249b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5feeb377977d0c670360aac1f48320065dc36d5a325b45b26d02ec7b87bf81a1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5bb0de7c4f59f781e4f554a0317c4a82a4c71e24f1f7f83719a817d5ae1a65af.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3d8a41ab29d31d3753f310cd42feadfd6d74e736c88481ca241bf38b993e7e11.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6141bba23a33377e37f6157b4c2f0aaa0390bba44f15728dec2b4962be27c347.jpg"],"titleId":"010023001a1bc000","dlc":[]}